+[v6 · 10.11.2026 · ZURIEL (ד4): נוסף §19 «המספר לא מוסתר, העומק כן» — בדגם התצוגה של מספרי יסוד וישויות זהב (במיוחד 1820) מנוי פותח עומק ואינו מסתיר את המספר, הגימטריות והחתימות. מקור: number_page_law v1. ללא שינוי הרשאות (§21).]
+
 [v4 · Human-Gate ZURIEL · 17.9.2026 — CAPABILITY PRESERVATION TREE · EXTEND_EXISTING]\n\nThis version preserves v3 in full and adds a forward product-planning invariant so approved capabilities do not disappear merely because they are not implemented yet.\n\n1. PRESERVE BY DEFAULT. Any capability explicitly approved by ZURIEL as desirable becomes part of the SOD1820 capability tree even if it is not yet implemented, priced, exposed or scheduled. Conversation-only approval is not enough long-term; the capability must be anchored in the canonical owner/tree.\n\n2. STATUS IS PLANNING, NOT AVAILABILITY. Every preserved capability may carry one planning state: NOW, NEXT, LATER, PARKED, CANCELLED, RETIRED. This status does not open the feature. Runtime availability remains owned by site_flags_lock_law. Entitlement remains owned by platform_tiers_law.\n\n3. ONLY EXPLICIT HUMAN-GATE REMOVES. A preserved capability may move to CANCELLED/RETIRED only after explicit ZURIEL decision. Lack of implementation, lack of pricing, low current priority, provider changes or temporary technical difficulty do not delete it. PARKED means remembered but intentionally inactive.\n\n4. ONE TREE / BOTTOM-UP. Build from foundations upward. Current dependency direction: Brand/Experience Context + Research/Truth/Access/Usage -> canonical engines (Gematria/Corpus/ELS) -> research projections -> Raziel -> Voice/Audio/Spatial/Media/Pulse/Cross-channel -> XR. Upper layers must consume lower owners rather than fork them.\n\n5. ELS IS EARLY FOUNDATION. ELS 2029 is prioritized as an early engine/projection foundation because later capabilities can consume it: ELS research -> spatial/3D ELS -> Raziel-in-ELS -> Raziel voice over ELS -> guided spatial research -> research-to-media. The new renderer may not fork the canonical ELS engine/corpus/coordinates/truth.\n\n6. FUTURE HOOKS/SLOTS. Canonical action surfaces should be able to expose semantic hooks such as listen, talk-to-Raziel, open-spatial, deep-research, create-brief, create-media, private-corpus, start-pulse. A hook may render BUILDING/COMING status without performing expensive I/O. No local hard-coded access truth.\n\n7. DO NOT FLOOD THE UI. A future capability may appear contextually where natural (for example Listen on Post, Spatial in ELS, Voice on Raziel), while a single central future/capability view may show the broader tree. The site must not become a wall of disabled buttons.\n\n8. CURRENT PRESERVED TREE. NOW: experience/capability infrastructure; ELS 2029 foundation. NEXT: ELS spatial/3D; Raziel inside ELS in text; Raziel Push-to-Talk and live voice foundation; Post Listen; Research Audio Briefing; Private Research Corpus. LATER: Research-to-Media; proactive Research Pulse; cross-channel companion continuity; guided high-end spatial research; XR/VR projection. These are priority buckets, not release promises; movement between NOW/NEXT/LATER/PARKED is allowed without deleting capability identity.\n\n9. DERIVATIVE IDEAS PRESERVED. Also preserved as first-class product concepts under existing capability families: Research Room (bounded long-running research dossier/workspace); Explain What I Am Looking At (Raziel explains current ELS/3D/UI selection/camera/context); Research Dossier (exportable structured record of methods, verified facts, interpretations, sources, Trace, media and spatial snapshots). These do not create new truth or owner systems.\n\n10. NO IDEA LOST BY DEFAULT. If an approved capability is deferred, it remains discoverable in governance/roadmap state and can be reactivated later. Defer != delete. Disable != cancel. Locked/building != rejected.\n\nOWNER CHECK: EXTEND_EXISTING platform_tiers_law + Experience/Raziel/ELS owners. No new product registry, entitlement engine, store, schema or pricing system is created by this version.
@@ -22 +24,8 @@
 
+[v6 · Human-Gate ZURIEL · 10.11.2026 (ד4) — NUMBER VISIBLE, DEPTH GATED · carried from number_page_law v1 (14.6.2026) · EXTEND_EXISTING]
+
+19. NUMBER VISIBLE, DEPTH GATED («המספר לא מוסתר, העומק כן»). Carried from number_page_law v1 within its original scope: the display model of foundation numbers and golden entities (especially 1820) and their number pages. A subscription never hides the number itself there: the number, its gematria values, its signatures and its basic DNA stay open to everyone, and the free layer may show a bounded sample of its matches. What a subscription opens is depth — for example advanced AI analysis, all graph paths, a personal message from the data, rare cross-references, unlimited journeys and depth reports. People do not pay to see the secret; they pay to go deeper into it.
+20. CARRY-OVER BOUNDARY. Only the access principle of number_page_law v1 is carried, without widening it to other numbers or other gates. Its three-layer page composition, the layer-1 hints, the example quota (~20 of 250 matches) and the tier name are not carried: page composition belongs to the current Number/Experience owners; quotas, plan names and prices remain future Human-Gate product decisions (§18). The tier name «בני ההיכל» is not carried (ZURIEL 11.11.2026: the name will be replaced; the new name awaits a Human-Gate decision).
+21. NO PERMISSION CHANGE. §§19–20 change no current permission, gate, flag or content lock; they state the invariant that the existing server-authoritative gates (§15) must keep.
+
+OWNER CHECK: EXTEND_EXISTING platform_tiers_law. No new entitlement engine, store, tier or plan.
